Subject: [PATCH] fix: decode baseline CMYK/YCCK as grayscale

Upstream: https://github.com/bitbank2/JPEGDEC/pull/125

Support interleaved 8-bit, 1x1-sampled CMYK/YCCK streams using the
existing MCU buffers. Recognize Adobe APP14 polarity and transform,
consume the fourth component, and reset its DC predictor at restarts.
Reject unsupported four-component layouts instead of misdecoding them.

Based on JPEGDEC 86282979224c8a32fd51e091ed5a35b0c699a52b with
CrossPoint patches 0001-0003 applied. No extra heap allocations.

